@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@stepId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Upload or replace a step image (multipart; set the file path for your machine)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/steps/{{stepId}}/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=StepImageBoundary

--StepImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="step.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./step.jpg
--StepImageBoundary--

### Download an image URL and assign it to a step
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/steps/{{stepId}}/image-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/step.jpg",
  "caption": null
}

### Remove the image from a step
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/steps/{{stepId}}/image
